<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- G11a-2 fixture, written by hand for the parity harness of PPP (no source music): the pedals of a piano in a repeated section. Bar 1: damper down at the start (printed), changed at beat 3 (a printed change: it lifts), up at the end of bar 2. Bars 2-4 are repeated. Bar 3: soft pedal down (sound only) until bar 4. Bar 4: sostenuto down at beat 3 (sound only). Bar 5: half damper (64, sound only) up at bar 6. Written order: 1 2 3 4 | 2 3 4 5 6 (the pedal events are copied into every visit, E4 c). -->
<score-partwise version="4.0">
  <work><work-title>Damper, soft and sostenuto pedals through a repeat</work-title></work>
